WEBVTT

00:02:58.633 --> 00:03:01.718
and everywhere you look,
it's kissing couples.

00:03:01.742 --> 00:03:03.670
(Laughter)

00:03:03.694 --> 00:03:07.426
Perhaps you're having a moment
of existential angst.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.879
You know, you're thinking
about your own mortality.

00:03:09.903 --> 00:03:12.875
And there, on the horizon,
it's the Grim Reaper.

00:03:12.899 --> 00:03:15.834
(Laughter)

00:03:15.858 --> 00:03:19.279
Or maybe you see a topless sunbather.

00:03:19.303 --> 00:03:20.908
(Laughter)

00:03:20.932 --> 00:03:23.980
What would that mean?

00:03:24.004 --> 00:03:29.511
What would that mean? I have no idea.

00:03:29.535 --> 00:03:31.741
But one thing I do know is this: